{"id":"n49068-3-7","stage":3,"title":"성장 · 成长","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49068-3-7-1","ko":"저 상표가 눈에 많이 띄네.","zh":"那个品牌的标识真显眼啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"상표가","meaning":"商标","explanation":"상표：商标；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"상표","audio":"/audio/e0f0335e3cc98ef6c400.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16491","senseId":"1","lemma":"상표","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"눈에","meaning":"眼睛","explanation":"눈：眼睛；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72704","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"띄네.","meaning":"突出，显示","explanation":"띄다：突出，显示；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"띄다","audio":"/audio/40a0dc104ee774d011f5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14468","senseId":"2","lemma":"띄다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"e0f0335e3cc98ef6","term":"상표","zh":"商标","audio":"/audio/e0f0335e3cc98ef6c400.mp3","entryId":"16491","definition":"标示制造商品的公司的记号或图画等标志。","pronunciation":["상표"]},{"id":"ab1b14816087979d","term":"눈","zh":"眼睛","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3","entryId":"72704","definition":"人或动物的一种感觉器官，位于脸部，受光线刺激后能看到物体。","pronunciation":["눈"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"40a0dc104ee774d0","term":"띄다","zh":"突出，显示","audio":"/audio/40a0dc104ee774d011f5.mp3","entryId":"14468","definition":"某种状态比平时看上去更明显。","pronunciation":["띠ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b259b6f2e24dcbb9dbff.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49068-3-7-2","ko":"저 회사가 요즘 엄청난 성장 속도를 보이고 있어.","zh":"那家公司最近的发展速度快得惊人。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"회사가","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"엄청난","meaning":"相当，特别","explanation":"엄청나다：相当，特别；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"엄청나다","audio":"/audio/d9539274e42f6bfd4c4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15118","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄청나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"성장","meaning":"成长，增长","explanation":"성장：成长，增长","readings":[{"term":"성장","audio":"/audio/2008c71775593d82ab3c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49068","senseId":"3","lemma":"성장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"속도를","meaning":"速度","explanation":"속도：速度；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"속도","audio":"/audio/c03f7e871a4127c448d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64215","senseId":"1","lemma":"속도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보이고","meaning":"显露，露出","explanation":"보이다：显露，露出；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"2","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"d9539274e42f6bfd","term":"엄청나다","zh":"相当，特别","audio":"/audio/d9539274e42f6bfd4c4d.mp3","entryId":"15118","definition":"量非常多或程度十分严重。","pronunciation":["엄청나다"]},{"id":"2008c71775593d82","term":"성장","zh":"成长，增长","audio":"/audio/2008c71775593d82ab3c.mp3","entryId":"49068","definition":"事物的规模或势力等逐渐壮大。","pronunciation":["성장"]},{"id":"c03f7e871a4127c4","term":"속도","zh":"速度","audio":"/audio/c03f7e871a4127c448d9.mp3","entryId":"64215","definition":"物体移动或事情进行的快慢。","pronunciation":["속또"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"显露，露出","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"观察对象而了解其内容或状态。","pronunciation":["보이다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/5e4287af7bb95dd89b84.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.222,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=49068","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"source